{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
		"name": "Studydoc User Service",
		"description": "# Studydoc User Microservice\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost:8090`\n**Keycloak:** `http://localhost:8180` — realm `studydocs-app`\n\n## Chuẩn bị\n1. `docker compose -f docker-compose-provider.yml up -d`\n2. Chạy Spring Boot (port 8090), load `.env`\n3. Cập nhật `clientSecret` nếu cần (Keycloak Admin → Clients → studydocs-app → Credentials)\n\n## Flow test nhanh (folder **00 - Quick Flow**)\n1. Register → 2. Login → 3. **Get Current User (me)** → 4. Các API business khác\n\n## Auth\n- Public: `/api/v1/public/auth/*` — không cần Bearer\n- Login trả `accessToken`, `refreshToken`, `expiresIn`\n\n## Business\n- Cần header: `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`\n- **GET /users/me** — giải token (Keycloak userinfo) → lấy `sub` → tra Mongo `keycloakId` → trả UserDTO + tự lưu `userId`\n- Các API còn lại dùng `{{userId}}` (Mongo id)\n\n## Response format\n```json\n{ \"statusCode\": 200, \"errorCode\": null, \"data\": { ... } }\n```",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8090" },
		{ "key": "keycloakUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8180" },
		{ "key": "realm", "value": "studydocs-app" },
		{ "key": "clientId", "value": "studydocs-app" },
		{ "key": "clientSecret", "value": "your-client-secret-here" },
		{ "key": "username", "value": "testuser01" },
		{ "key": "password", "value": "12345678" },
		{ "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "userId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "keycloakSub", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "googleRedirectUri", "value": "studydocs://callback" },
		{ "key": "googleCode", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "googleCodeVerifier", "value": "" }
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "00 - Quick Flow",
			"description": "Chạy lần lượt từ trên xuống. Đổi `username` nếu Register báo trùng.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Register",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Register OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.expect(json.statusCode).to.eql(200);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Test User\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/auth/register"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Login OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/auth/login"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Get Current User (me)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Get me OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.data?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.data.id);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "4. Get User By Id",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
